            "description": "<p>US stocks (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EDJI\">^DJI</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC\">^GSPC</a>,<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EIXIC\"> ^IXIC</a>) <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/this-isnt-your-grandfathers-sp-500-wall-street-strategists-say-stocks-could-keep-rising-from-records-150045296.html\">reached record highs</a> last week, but are <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/news/live/stock-market-today-dow-sp-500-nasdaq-futures-pull-back-from-records-as-gold-powers-to-fresh-high-234423457.html\">pulling back on Monday</a>. Yahoo Finance Senior Reporter <a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/brooke-dipalma/?fr=sycsrp_catchall\">Brooke DiPalma</a> joins Morning Brief host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/\">Julie Hyman</a> to discuss the latest market action.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/morning-brief/\">Morning Brief</a>.</p>",
